FormListOverrideIncompatibleTitle = Detected but not compatible lists (%s)
FormListOverrideIncompatibleHelp = The module cannot act on these lists.
FormListOverrideReasonNoAction = its search form does not post action=list
FormListOverrideReasonNoHook = the page does not call the doActions hook
FORMLISTOVERRIDE_ACCEPT_EMPTY_ACTION = Accept searches without action
FORMLISTOVERRIDE_ACCEPT_EMPTY_ACTION_Tooltip = Some lists (users, contacts, agenda...) post no action field with their search. When enabled, a search without action is converted to GET too, and these lists are offered below. A request carrying another action is never converted. Save to refresh the offered lists.
