FormListOverrideNoActionPosted = no action
FormListOverrideReasonEmptyAction = its form posts no action: enable "Accept searches without action"
FORMLISTOVERRIDE_DRYRUN = Dry-run (log only)
FORMLISTOVERRIDE_DRYRUN_Tooltip = When enabled, the target GET URL is written to the Dolibarr log (LOG_DEBUG) instead of performing the redirect. Use it to validate the behavior on your install before enabling it for real.


